    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >MultiMaze is a party game, for 1 to 6 players, where players race through numerous labyrinths with unique and chaotic mechanics. </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Chaotic matches:</strong> Race through mazes filled with traps, all while dodging the cunning of your opponents. Death awaits at every turn! </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Very easy to pick up, difficult to master:</strong> The game is fun for all, and offers challenges, regardless of the players' skill levels competing. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fast-paced:</strong> The races follow one another at a breakneck pace, and death won't give you time to breathe.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Infinite replayability:</strong> Thanks to procedural generation, each game offers a unique experience, ensuring great replayability!  </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Varied levels:</strong> Each maze has its own atmosphere and unique mechanics!</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Funny characters:</strong> Choose from animals that are all more adorable than the next.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Multiple game modes:</strong> Race, survival, evolving challenge.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Player interactions:</strong> Whether by pushing or shooting fireballs, all means are good to hinder your opponents.</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >MultiMaze is a party game, for 1 to 6 players, where players race through numerous labyrinths with unique and chaotic mechanics. </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Chaotic matches:</strong> Race through mazes filled with traps, all while dodging the cunning of your opponents. Death awaits at every turn! </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Very easy to pick up, difficult to master:</strong> The game is fun for all, and offers challenges, regardless of the players' skill levels competing. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fast-paced:</strong> The races follow one another at a breakneck pace, and death won't give you time to breathe.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Infinite replayability:</strong> Thanks to procedural generation, each game offers a unique experience, ensuring great replayability!  </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Varied levels:</strong> Each maze has its own atmosphere and unique mechanics!</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Funny characters:</strong> Choose from animals that are all more adorable than the next.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Multiple game modes:</strong> Race, survival, evolving challenge.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Player interactions:</strong> Whether by pushing or shooting fireballs, all means are good to hinder your opponents.</p></li></ul>",
